      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "NaafiriQ",
        "name": "Darkin Daggers",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Naafiri hurls up to two daggers, each inflicting bleed, or each inflicting bonus damage if the target is already bleeding.<br><br>Packmates leap to attack the first champion or monster hit by this skill.<br>",
        "bodyHtml": "Naafiri hurls Darkin-tainted blades, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\"> physical damage</span> and inflicting a bleed, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\"> physical damage</span> over seconds.<br /><br />Naafiri can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> this Ability. If enemies hit are already bleeding from this Ability, it instead deals the remaining bleed damage plus between <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\"></span> and <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\"> physical damage</span>, based on their missing Health. If that target was a champion or large monster, Naafiri restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\"> Health</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Packmates</span> will leap at the first champion or monster hit and attack them for seconds. <br /><br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Executes lane minions and non-epic monsters below 30 health.</span>",
