      "R": {
        "slot": "R",
        "id": "NaafiriW",
        "name": "Hounds' Pursuit",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Naafiri and her packmates dash at a champion, dealing damage. Naafiri reveals nearby enemies if she scores a takedown and can recast this Ability once. The second cast grants a shield.",
        "bodyHtml": "Naafiri dashes at an enemy champion, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(125/200/275 + (100% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and briefly <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> them. <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Packmates</span> become Untargetable and dash alongside Naafiri, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(12.5/20/27.5 + (10% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> per <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Packmate</span>.<br /><br />If Naafiri scores a Takedown within 7 seconds she reveals nearby enemies and can recast this Ability once. The second cast grants <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(100/150/200 + (150% bonus Attack Damage)) Shield</span> for 3 seconds.<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Briefly extends<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\"> The Call of the Pack</span>.</span>",
